            "text": "{\"draft_title\":\"2026-10-27_23-11-00 Targeted Harassment with the Ghost Train\",\"draft_subtitle\":\"Second incident in this town in which I am delayed by a train’s stop light, and as I wait, the ghost train goes by. The silver lining? At least I am not targeted to be ran over by the train... yet.LOL\",\"draft_podcast_url\":null,\"draft_podcast_duration\":null,\"draft_body\":\"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"doc\\\",\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"paragraph\\\",\\\"attrs\\\":{\\\"textAlign\\\":null}}]}\",\"section_chosen\":true,\"draft_section_id\":null,\"translations\":[],\"draft_bylines\":[{\"id\":148159693,\"is_guest\":false}],\"last_updated_at\":\"2026-11-03T21:03:03.354Z\",\"audience\":\"everyone\"}"
